  "meta": {
    "label": "Rounded Rectangle",
    "category": "2d primitives",
    "color": "#0891b2"
  },
  "description": "2D primitive — a Length × Breadth rectangle with filleted corners (Corner Radius), centred at (X, Y), optionally rotated. Emits a Space polygon.",
  "instructions": "A ROUNDED RECTANGLE — Length × Breadth with each corner filleted at `cornerRadius` metres (clamped to half the smaller side; radius = half the smaller side ⇒ a stadium / slot). Centred at (centerX, centerY), rotated by `rotation`°. Emits a closed Space polygon (furniture, rugs, pads). All params wireable. Publishes `val-length` / `val-breadth`.",
